; desert_village_c.tres — Desert village variant C.
; Four compact buildings arranged in a cluster with a central well (round bricks).
; Palette: tan (16) + sand-yellow (17) walls, white (0) tile roofs, iron accents.
; NPCs: 4 desert-skin wandering builders.
; DOCS.md §2 — desert village structure; CONTEXT.md D-07 (3-5 variants), D-09 (NPC slots).

